Privacy Policy — 10 Complications
Last updated: May 11, 2026

Data Collection
10 Complications does not collect, store, or transmit any data to external servers.

Location Data
The app requests access to device GPS location solely to calculate sunrise, sunset, moonrise, moonset times.
Location data is stored locally on the device only and is never shared with third parties.

